# Development environments
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# System
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Editor and assistant droppings
.claude/

# Game textures. The game (or the Workshop upload) writes a .dds beside every PNG in Mod/Textures:
# seventy-three of them, 26 MB against the PNGs' few hundred kilobytes. Steam takes Mod/ as it stands
# on disk, so they travel with an upload whatever git does; git does not carry them. If one is ever
# wanted in the history, force-add it deliberately.
*.dds

# Windows Explorer folder icons belong in Art/, outside Mod/. Mod/desktop.ini is ignored above and
# its target is ..\Art\Preview.ico; an icon dropped inside Mod/ would be shipped to every player.
Mod/**/*.ico

# Test evidence stays on disk, never in git: screenshots and Player.log grow without limit.
# What deserves versioning is one text line per run in docs/runs/, cited by STATUS.md.
Tests/Pickle/Evidence/
evidence/

# Written by scripts/Render-Preview.cjs on every run: a byte-for-byte copy of Mod/About/Preview.png.
Art/qa/Preview-candidate.png
